<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment rises to 13.3 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment rises to 13.3 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland rose to 13.3 percent of the workforce in November from 13.2 percent in October, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	NOVEMBER    OCTOBER	NOVEMBER 95</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.307	2.286	   2.597</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    13.3	 13.2	    14.7</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
